            "text_xYkVGw": {
              "type": "text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h3>The Golden Age — 1960s</h3><p>The 1960s represent the golden age of women’s wrestling. The skirted designs of the previous decade largely disappeared, replaced by the classic swimsuit-style wrestling suits that came to define the period.</p><p>Many incorporated structured, built-in bras, giving the garments strength and rigidity while creating the distinctive silhouette seen throughout 1960s wrestling photography. The late Cheryl Day remains one of my favourite wrestlers from this era.</p>",
                "width": "100%",
                "max_width": "narrow",
