              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h3>The Rise of Japanese Women’s Wrestling</h3><p>By the late 1960s, women’s wrestling was developing rapidly in Japan. All Japan Women’s Pro-Wrestling (AJW) emerged as one of the organisations that would help shape the sport for years to come.</p><p>Its wrestlers became renowned for their extraordinary fitness, preparation and training. Competition for places was intense, with prospective wrestlers undergoing demanding selection and conditioning before earning their place.</p>",
