            "text_KxUPaV": {
              "type": "text",
              "name": "t:names.text",
              "settings": {
                "text": "<h3>A Changing Look — 1970s to 1990s</h3><p>By the late 1970s, wrestling fashion was beginning to change dramatically. Higher-cut swimsuits appeared alongside increasingly elaborate costumes, make-up and more theatrical presentation.</p><p>Through the 1980s and 1990s, the simple, classic aesthetic of the 1960s became increasingly difficult to find. Although elements of the earlier style survived — particularly within Japanese wrestling — the distinctive look that inspired this collection was gradually disappearing.</p>",
